Package: reratos
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to the Eratos Data Management Platform
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", , "bangyou.zheng@csiro.au", role = c("aut", "cre"), 
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1551-0970"))
    )
Description: Provides a comprehensive R interface to the Eratos data management 
    platform (<https://www.eratos.com>). Enables users to programmatically access, retrieve, 
    and manage sensor data, workflows, observations, and other research data 
    through the Eratos API. Designed for researchers and data scientists working 
    with agricultural and environmental monitoring data who need to integrate 
    Eratos data into their R-based analysis workflows.
